{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-12-1","title":"Isaiah 12:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 A joyful thanksgiving of the faithful for the mercies of God.</p>\n<p>And in that. 2:11; 11:10,11,16; 14:3; 26:1; 27:1-3,12,13; 35:10; Zec 14:9,20 O Lord. 25:1,9; 49:13; 60:18,19; Ps 34:1-22; 67:1-4; 69:34-36; 72:15-19 Ps 149:6-9; Ro 11:15; Re 15:3,4; 19:1-7 though. 10:4,25; 40:1,2; 51:3; 54:8; 57:15-18; 66:13; De 30:1-3; Ps 30:5 Ps 85:1-3; Jer 31:18-20; Eze 39:24-29; Ho 6:1; 11:8; 14:4-9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-12-2","title":"Isaiah 12:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>God. 7:14; 9:6,7; 45:17,22-25; Ps 27:1; Jer 3:23; 23:6; Jon 2:9 Mt 1:21-23; Lu 2:30-32; Ro 1:16; 1Ti 3:16; Re 7:10 the Lord. 26:4; Ex 15:2; Ps 83:18; 118:14; Ho 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-12-3","title":"Isaiah 12:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>with joy. 49:10; 55:1-3; Ps 36:9; So 2:3; Jer 2:13; Joh 1:16; 4:10-14 Joh 7:37-39; Re 7:17; 22:1,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-12-4","title":"Isaiah 12:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>in that day. 1; Ps 106:47,48; 113:1-3; 117:1,2 call upon his name. or, proclaim his name. Ex 33:19; 34:5-7; 1Ch 16:8; Ps 105:1 declare. 66:19; Ps 9:11; 22:31; 40:5; 71:16-18; 73:28; 96:3; 107:22; 145:4-6 Jer 50:2; 51:9,10; Joh 17:26 his name. 2:11,17; 25:1; 33:5; Ex 15:2; 1Ch 29:11; Ne 9:5; Ps 18:46; 21:13 Ps 34:3; 46:10; 57:5; 97:9; 113:5; Php 2:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-12-5","title":"Isaiah 12:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Sing. Ex 15:1,21; Ps 68:32-35; 98:1; 105:2; Re 15:3; 19:1-3 this is known. 40:9; Ps 72:19; Hab 2:14; Re 11:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-12-6","title":"Isaiah 12:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Cry out. 40:9; 52:7-10; 54:1; Zep 3:14; Lu 19:37-40 thou. 10:24; 30:19; 33:24; Zec 8:3-8 inhabitant. Heb. inhabitress. great. 8:18; 24:23; 41:14,16; Ps 9:11; 68:16; 71:22; 89:18; 132:14; Eze 43:7 Eze 48:35; Zep 2:5; 3:15-17; Zec 2:5,10,11</p>"}]}